  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multinational Nacala Road Corridor Development Project Phase V (Malawi)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities of the project are: (i) Rehabilitation of the 55km road between Nsipe and Liwonde towns in Malawi; (ii) Construction of a One-Stop-Border-Post (OSBP) between Malawi and Mozambique at the Chiponde/Mandimba Border Post; and (iii) Feasibility study and detailed engineering design of the 47 km road between Mangochi and Chiponde.</narrative>
  </description>
